Package: RNAiMachinerySearch
Title: RNAi Machinery Search
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Gustavo", "Gonçalves", , "gustavoffg@estudante.ufscar.br", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: RNAiMachinerySearch is a fast and optimized R package for screening genes involved in RNA interference (RNAi) in eukaryotes. 
  It provides tools to analyze transcriptomic datasets annotated with UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot from RNA-seq experiments, 
  identifying core RNAi machinery components and classifying them into functional categories such as Dicer-like, Argonaute/Piwi, 
  dsRNA-binding, dsRNA-transport, and auxiliary RISC-associated proteins. The package enables assessment of gene expression profiles 
  across experimental groups and produces ready-to-use visualizations for publications or presentations.
